---
manual: element.check
lines: [1945, 1947]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  stack do
    flow { $frances = check; para "Frances Johnson" }
    flow { check; para "Ignatius J. Reilly" }
    flow { check; para "Winston Niles Rumfoord" }
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_instance_of Shoes::Check, $frances, "check returns a Shoes::Check"
assert_equal 3, checks.size, "each call adds a check box"
assert_same $frances, check("$frances").obj, "the returned check box is the one in the window"
